{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03804","headline":"昭君怨二首 一 · 董思恭","name":"昭君怨二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新年犹尚小，那堪远聘秦。\n裾衫沾马汗，眉黛染胡尘。\n举眼无相识，路逢皆异人。\n唯有梅将李，犹带故乡春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"董思恭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03804.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03804","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}